WEBVTT

00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:10.480
Claire... why?

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.230
I hear it was an awful way to go.

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:16.240
They're saying it was the 
curse of the old library...

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.070
You mean the ghost's curse is real?

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:22.250
Why isn't Gareth here?

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.320
He can't exactly show his face right now.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:33.060
Goddess Serrass, bestower of light,

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:38.580
guide this pour soul to 
the gardens of Graseel,

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:43.390
and let her protect us as a martyr of heroes.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.070
Gareth?

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:02.540
Faria, excuse me a minute.

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:04.660
Nemo?

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:11.130
Gareth.

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:16.910
Claire is dead because of me.

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:27.690
Did you love Claire?

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:30.060
I don't know.

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:34.350
But I know that Claire loved me.

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:38.410
I knew that, and yet I...

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:41.300
I used her.

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:50.020
I'm going to find Claire's killer.

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:51.980
It's the least I can do to honor her memory.

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:53.560
By yourself?

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:57.220
Tell the president for me.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:44.760
<b>Sortie\h\h\h-Apocalypse-</b>

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:42.740
The Burgot Volcano?

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:47.420
The name must back memories 
for you, Council President Faria.

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:54.000
Yes. It's where my ancestor, Eunomia, 
settled things with the despicable Physis.

00:03:54.390 --> 00:03:56.470
But what is its relevance now?

00:03:56.900 --> 00:04:01.940
A massive underground facility 
has been discovered there.

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:07.710
We're not sending you out to fight
 for our own amusement.

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:08.750
Look here.

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:13.290
This is...

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:17.300
The small points represent the 
battles of the last year or so

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:20.650
where monsters destroyed 
excavation sites and cities.

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:26.410
It's an indication that the Burgot Volcano 
is being infused with magical power.

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:30.790
Don't tell me that the power 
of the broken silver hourglasses is...

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:35.110
After the great destruction of our world,

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:39.800
the Goddess Serrass was just 
barely able to keep it one piece.

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:44.010
In other words, like a glass 
shattered and mended.

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:49.160
And the the silver hourglasses 
are what holds it together?

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:51.560
Precisely.

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:54.560
We have no time to lose.

00:04:54.560 --> 00:05:01.220
Before Physis can use the magic of the 
silver hourglasses for their own ambitions,

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:04.580
Granseed must destroy the cult 
with an all-out offensive.

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:08.310
But we don't know the extent 
of the enemy's strength.

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:10.580
It's reckless to send our entire army in.

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:13.450
According to our scouting reports,

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:19.710
Physis's leader, Amis Germain,
is in that underground base.

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:22.210
You were able to learn that much?

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:25.590
As I said, we are not playing around here.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:31.850
Gareth Winswald's recklessness is causing 
trouble for the imperial elites.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:37.180
There's also concern about your character 
as student council president.

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:41.180
So you want us to justify our 
existence through action?

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:43.830
Surely that's overstating the case...

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:45.110
Forgive me.

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:48.480
We couldn't defeat Physis 
without you and yours.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:51.870
As loathe as we are to admit it...

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:54.140
The dragon's rampage.

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:56.810
The possession of Prince Gildan.

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:59.690
And Claire's death.

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:03.130
The enemy is hiding in our academy.

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:09.460
We must root them out entirely 
before things grow truly grave.

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:11.390
Would you not agree?

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:14.420
Understood.

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:16.300
I'll form a squadron.

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:20.070
Are you sure about this?

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:24.900
The student council only has autonomy 
within the bounds of the academy.

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:28.820
The chairman's will is the 
will of Els, Empire of Light.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:29.970
President.

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:35.290
I can tell when you're putting on a front.

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:38.060
It's true that I'm not fond of the idea.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:41.540
This isn't like our usual 
monster-slaying expeditions.

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:44.680
It may very well be the
 decisive battle against Physis.

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:46.630
Yet should it turn out to be a diversion...

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:51.070
Still, we can't simply 
leave them there, can we?

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:56.210
What I'd really like is to make more 
preparations before we set out.

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:59.190
I might have just the plan!

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:08.220
Boy, I really need more training!

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:13.530
Nemo! Jou! Did you hear?

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:14.950
It's an all-out offensive!

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:17.160
Time to show our stuff!

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.160
Guess the board's finally 
getting off its ass!

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:21.210
Have you fully recovered, Gildan?

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.670
Right as rain!

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.840
You won't catch me lying around
 when there's Physis to crush.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.730
I like that attitude.

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:30.070
We'll all need to make up
 for Gareth's absence.

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:31.200
Yeah...

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:32.220
Fair point.

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:35.830
Oh yeah, Nemo!

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:38.420
What kind of place is the Burgot Volcano?

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:40.850
I wouldn't know. I've never been there.

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:43.640
Huh? Ain't it close to your hometown?

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:45.230
Er, well...

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:48.140
We just called it the mountain.

00:07:48.140 --> 00:07:50.220
Hey, I feel you.

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:52.240
Our country has a name too, but...

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:02.430
Is it hard for you, Nemo?

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:04.000
Miss Sophitia...

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:07.800
The death of a student always is.

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:10.760
It can be difficult to accept.

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:14.160
I didn't know anything about Claire.

00:08:14.690 --> 00:08:19.410
But I can tell everyone's 
sad that she's gone.

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:23.010
You're a kind young man.

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:29.080
I think that's why your hero 
is helping you, Nemo.

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:34.030
I'm sure you'll be able to save everyone.

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:36.840
Save everyone?

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:43.870
This very academy was founded 
to put an end to such sadness.

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:48.040
I believe you will see its wish realized.

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.390
Lady Eunomia?

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:55.050
Please, don't startle me like that...

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:56.800
<i>Faria.</i>

00:08:58.190 --> 00:08:59.870
<i>When this battle is over,</i>

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:03.060
<i>there is something you must bring to light.</i>

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:05.690
Something I must bring to light?

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:09.360
<i>Reveal the truth of the old library.</i>

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:13.610
Lady Eunomia?

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:21.060
The old head librarian, Genius...

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:24.980
He was undoubtedly an agent of Physis.

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:31.830
Genius was slain by Eunomia,

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:37.090
but Eunomia died of the curse soon after.

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:41.210
If that curse is what killed Claire,

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:44.500
I'll...

00:09:45.590 --> 00:09:52.170
Little bugs who have never seen the sky...

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:59.070
Rush across the land on a journey...

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:00.310
Good morning.

00:10:00.310 --> 00:10:04.060
Nemo... I didn't wake you, did I?

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:05.930
No, don't worry.

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:08.550
You sing that song a lot, don't you?

00:10:09.050 --> 00:10:12.840
I'm told that Lady Eunomia 
sang it frequently.

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:15.920
Your hero? I see...

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:19.930
Lady Eunomia destroyed Physis, and yet...

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:24.370
The fact that we're still 
having to do this ourselves...

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:27.660
Are you fighting for everyone, too?

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:28.810
Of course I am!

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:31.810
At least, I wish that were the case...

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:37.570
The truth is, there are 
times I'm not certain.

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:42.070
I was born and raised to save us all.

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:46.500
But is it because I wanted to?

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:50.580
Or was I merely doing what 
my father expected of me?

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:55.120
Still, you saved me.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:57.660
Not just me, either.

00:10:57.660 --> 00:11:00.680
I think you're still saving us all.

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:03.240
Thank you.

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:25.530
The scale of this operation is greater
than any we've undertaken before.

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:27.140
Let's show our stuff!

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:29.480
Leave the ground forces to us!

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:34.620
If Physis's objective is to interfere 
with the silver hourglasses,

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:37.160
they must be plotting the mass 
destruction of the continent.

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:41.560
Let us be victorious and return here as one.

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:49.110
We're over the Burgot Volcano.

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:50.060
Everything is on schedule.

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:52.190
Fire the flares!

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:54.690
That's the signal!

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:02.200
Let's go!

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:05.320
Charge!

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:07.590
We'll clear 'em out ourselves!

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:09.160
Succession!

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:13.790
That's the signal!

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:18.780
Okay!

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:20.670
Succession!

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:22.330
Let's go, everyone!

00:12:31.380 --> 00:12:35.920
President, Jou and Gildan are in position.

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:36.970
Understood.

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:40.320
Shall we, then?

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:41.590
Drop!

00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:47.320
Succession!

00:12:57.370 --> 00:13:00.300
Kaiser Phoenix!

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:08.550
Impressive indeed!

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:11.430
Ellen, you handle things here.

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:16.000
Work with Jou and the others 
to safeguard our advance.

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:17.640
Succession!

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:19.430
Succession!

00:13:18.390 --> 00:13:19.930
Roger that.

00:13:19.930 --> 00:13:22.080
Take care, you three!

00:13:25.210 --> 00:13:26.430
Succession!

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:30.830
You're no match!

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:48.840
Faria! Shirley! I'll back you up!

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.150
We'll be counting on you!

00:13:50.150 --> 00:13:51.260
Thank you!

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:09.590
What is this place?

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:14.010
It's almost like a factory for homunculi...

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:17.120
Artificial beings created by alchemists.

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:19.990
Look!

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:23.210
This capsule is broken.

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:25.440
What did it contain?

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:26.810
Look out!

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.510
Oh? Impressive evasion...

00:14:33.610 --> 00:14:35.210
Glad to see it.

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:38.350
Who are you people?

00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:40.810
That armor...

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:42.300
Are you a successor?!

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:43.360
It can't be!

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:46.700
Servants of destruction could never be 
vessels for the goddess's protection!

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:52.810
We were chosen by the Great God Nestra 
to bring about a new, ideal world.

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.640
My name is Reda,

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:57.390
and I wield the power of 
Immortal Empress Irene...

00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:01.880
to bestow destruction upon all of you!

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:04.480
Faria, Shirley, be careful.

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:06.760
These are no ordinary successors.

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:08.630
What do you mean?

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:09.260
Incoming!

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.170
They separated us?

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:24.690
What's wrong, Seven Knights?!

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:28.440
Lightning Speed!

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:33.950
I have you now!

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:37.050
What?!

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:38.450
Shocked?

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:43.710
I'm Volux, the black mage of Hero Mercure.

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:45.290
And this is...

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:48.880
Now let's have some fun.

00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:54.250
Let all be destroyed!

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:02.360
It's no use.

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:05.400
My Hero Dellons is the knight of destruction.

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:09.150
The likes of you can't stop me.

00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:11.530
My name is Castres!

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:18.330
Show me the power you used to beat a vampire!

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:29.070
Snowfield Slash!

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:41.120
You're wounded! Get back!

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:42.170
Don't worry.

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:45.730
Dragon Guardian Jive and 
I will support you!

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:48.230
Come at me!

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:54.030
How disappointing.

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:57.270
Is <i>this</i> really the power 
that once destroyed Physis?

00:16:58.050 --> 00:17:02.580
Our power doesn't lie in us as individuals.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:05.420
Is that the best you can come up with?

00:17:15.390 --> 00:17:17.760
Keep your focus where it belongs!

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:30.970
Fight me!

00:17:30.970 --> 00:17:34.320
A knight's greatest honor is a duel!

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:36.720
Let me ask you something, Castres.

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:38.340
What is it now?

00:17:38.340 --> 00:17:42.080
Do you value the lives of Reda and Volux?

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:46.220
No more than I value my own.

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:50.340
Destruction is the only 
righteous fate for this world.

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:53.340
I thought that's what you'd say...

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:54.760
What are you getting at?!

00:17:55.480 --> 00:17:58.340
I'm not like that anymore.

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:13.110
No use!

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:19.990
Such meager power is 
no more than an empty threat!

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:23.870
What?!

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:26.450
Faria!

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:27.370
Nemo!

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:28.580
What are you doing here?

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:31.250
I want to save Faria!

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:33.210
Wretched Castres!

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.750
Can't you even hold one of them off?!

00:18:35.770 --> 00:18:38.510
The Seven Knights fight as a team!

00:18:40.030 --> 00:18:41.400
We trust each other.

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:42.550
We uplift each other.

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:46.850
That's why we can all fight together!

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:48.770
Utter nonsense.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:13.080
She's not your opponent.

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:17.690
I am!

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:23.390
You're late, Castres!

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:25.840
Late?!

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:29.810
I'm not here to help you,

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:31.390
you weakling!

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:43.660
Nemo!

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:48.730
You... You saved me?

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:52.250
I don't want you guys to die, either!

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:54.420
I just...

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:56.870
I want to protect this world!

00:19:56.870 --> 00:19:58.630
That's all!

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:04.750
The time has come.

00:20:05.940 --> 00:20:07.850
Just as prophesied.

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:13.730
Great Goddess Nestra, 
sleeping in the dark abyss...

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:18.300
Use thy sacred hands which 
burn all corruption pure,

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:21.990
thine eyes which permit 
no evil in their sight...

00:20:22.210 --> 00:20:25.960
Grant me the will to bring my revolution!

00:20:27.020 --> 00:20:27.770
<i>Not good!</i>

00:20:27.770 --> 00:20:29.530
<i>I sense some kind of power rising!</i>

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:32.040
This feeling...

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:34.540
Don't tell me...

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:38.840
Shirley?

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:39.690
President!

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:41.210
He suddenly...

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:46.970
That's the power of destruction, my dear.

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:48.340
Possession?

00:20:50.730 --> 00:20:53.290
That's right, weakling.

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:56.080
It's begun...

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:57.610
The end of the world!

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:04.820
We're beyond anything you could hope to beat.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:13.520
There's no question.

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:16.080
Claire was investigating the old library.

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:18.840
She found something in this forbidden place,

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:22.140
and then the curse took her.

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:28.150
What is this?

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:42.230
This altar... A Physis design?

00:21:45.550 --> 00:21:46.460
Could it be?

00:23:25.470 --> 00:23:27.340
We are the Sons of Destruction.

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:28.650
We're nothing like you.

00:23:28.650 --> 00:23:31.000
The heroes entrusted this age to us!

00:23:31.000 --> 00:23:33.600
I must save this world.

00:23:33.600 --> 00:23:34.950
For Claire!

00:23:34.950 --> 00:23:36.800
Next time: "Conflict."

00:23:35.490 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Rivalry -Conflict-</b>

00:23:36.800 --> 00:23:39.350
Everyone's shouting the same thing.
